# Raw archive mirror — deliberately NOT committed to this public repo: it holds
# the byte-exact original pages including the copyrighted song lyrics. Recreate
# it locally with `make mirror` (a Wayback crawl); CI checks it out from the
# private mirror repo. See README "source of truth -> build".
mirror/

# Built faithful site (regenerate with `make dist` from mirror/)
dist/

